.TH DEEPIN-IMAN 1 "August 2026" "deepin-iman 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
deepin-iman \- AI-powered man page viewer for deepin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deepin-iman
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B deepin-iman
is a man page browser that deeply integrates AI capabilities with the
traditional man page experience. It allows users to browse, search, and
navigate all man pages, and leverages AI to provide Chinese translation,
usage examples, command Q&A, and command parsing.
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Full-text search
Search across all man pages using SQLite FTS5 full-text indexing.
.TP
.B Cross-reference navigation
Click SEE ALSO links to jump between related man pages.
.TP
.B AI translation
Multi-provider AI translation (OpenAI/Claude/Qwen/GLM) with preset
Chinese translation packages and local caching.
.TP
.B Side-by-side view
Chinese and English man pages displayed side by side.
.TP
.B AI examples
AI-generated usage examples with annotations and expected output.
.TP
.B Embedded terminal
Run commands directly within the application.
.TP
.B Cheat sheets
AI-generated quick reference cards, exportable as PDF or Markdown.
.TP
.B Learning history
Browse history with AI-generated weekly learning reports.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/deepin-iman/
Application data directory (index, cache, history, favorites).
.TP
.I ~/.config/deepin-iman/
Configuration directory (QSettings).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man (1),
.BR mandoc (1),
.BR groff (1)
